  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nakwalele Slaughter House Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Food Processing (Meat Products), Beneficiaries: 46 Small Scale Livestock Farmers, NADO offers slaughter house facilities and services to members and non-members at a fee. NADO provides members with butchery space at a fee for the processing and sale of various meat products. The group has applied for funding from USADF to assist in modernizing both the slaughter house and the butchery structure. They will also go through considerable management, food processing, and financial systems training in line with their business.</narrative>
  </description>
